<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>MacMenuBar.com (中文)</title><link>https://macmenubar.com</link><description>一个收录了1600多款Mac菜单栏应用的精选目录。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 12:52:59 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>StatusPerch</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/statusperch/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/statusperch.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="StatusPerch" height="201" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/statusperch.webp" width="600"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
